flowchart TD
    A([Staff member needs a file]) --> B[Sign in]
    B --> C{Role}
    C -->|Manager / Officer / Dept staff / Student| D[Search home<br/>search box + browse by type]
    D --> E[Type query and press Enter<br/>name, reg. no., reference no., keywords]
    E --> F[[Access control trims the index<br/>to documents the role may see]]
    F --> G[Ranked results<br/>snippets, badges, facets with counts]
    G --> H{Is the document<br/>on the first page?}
    H -->|Yes| K[Open document detail<br/>metadata, highlighted text, related docs]
    H -->|Too many results| I[Refine: filters - type, department,<br/>year, access - or sort / advanced fields]
    I --> G
    G -->|0 results| J[No-results page<br/>did you mean, remove filters,<br/>search by number, browse, ask Records Office]
    J --> E
    K --> L[Download - logged in the audit trail]
    K --> M[Back to results with query kept]
    M --> G
    L --> N([Task complete<br/>typically 3 actions])
